  "description": "An arson video leak of top actor \"Haerun\" breaks out, and Haerun and her agency search for the person who spread it.  \nHowever, the culprit is hard to find, and there is a suspicious person, so only her feelings grow without any evidence. Yeonkyung Soo who was a close friend of Hae-run in the past and resembles her comes to visit Hearun.  \nYeonkyung Soo, a girl who cursed her fate even though it bloomed as a white water lily in muddy water, and Haerun, a woman who became a monster herself. What is the truth they are hiding...?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61319322), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%86%90%ED%86%B1%EB%8B%AC/3994)",
